  "description": "Forest Bandit grounds (Oakenshire) extension, anchor (245, 768): a back row of tents round a second fire, an east tent pair, a practice target and a broken wagon at the west approach. Reuses the camp's own tent, fire and target models and camp A's wagon.",
  "entry": "anchor",
  "clear": [],
